/>

<ExecutiveSignal
  whyItMatters="Reusable agent behavior now moves between projects like software dependencies, except useful local variation is part of the problem. Enterprises need to know what changed, what should propagate, and what actually ran."
  takeaway="Govern lineage, project binding, conditions of use, execution evidence, and acceptance as distinct but connected responsibilities. Do not equate a current registry record with a trustworthy run."
